    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d277">

                <pb facs="0360" n="286" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg286"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/752</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Garrett</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The Hague</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-12-04T16:00:00+00:19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 4, 1917, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11.20 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1723. Minister of Foreign Affairs in conversation confirms the report that Dutch
                    Minister at Petrograd refused to receive communication from Maximalist
                    government. Loudon has notified him of this Government’s approval. …</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Garrett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
